# Linear issue status

The board that should make sense at a glance is **Todo → In Progress → Done**.

- **Todo** — queued work we will do. Create new ready issues here, not in Backlog.
- **In Progress** — the slice we were asked to start. Move it here in the same step. Leave it here until the pull request is merged to `main`.
- **Done** — the work is on `main`. Do not mark Done from a branch or an unmerged PR.
- **Backlog** — later work only (not this version yet).

When the user says start this task, move that issue to In Progress immediately so it shows on the Kanban.
